---
title: "get_price_no_older_than (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get: price = get_price_unsafe(price_info_object)
    q_get --> q_fresh_check: check_price_is_fresh(price, clock, max_age_secs)
    q_fresh_check --> q_abort: age >= max_age_secs, abort E_STALE_PRICE_UPDATE
    q_fresh_check --> [*]: age < max_age_secs, return price

    note right of q_fresh_check
        INV-001: age = abs_diff(clock_time/1000, price_timestamp)
        INV-002: aborts if price age >= max_age_secs (strict less-than check)
        INV-003: caller can specify custom max_age_secs independent of state threshold
    end note
